<title>USA: Erie Indemnity says CFO to retire.</title>
<headline>Erie Indemnity says CFO to retire.</headline>
<dateline>ERIE, Penna. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Erie Indemnity Co said Wednesday that its Chief Financial Officer Thomas Sider will retire effective June 30.</p>
<p>The company said it will search internally and externally for a replacement CFO.</p>
<p>Sider was first named an officer of the company in 1978.</p>
